    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "The iron plates bear deep gouges from blades and fire, yet they hold firm against the crushing weight of battle. A strange, frantic energy pulses through the metal, quickening the pulse and sharpening the senses of the one who dons it."
